From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Reinsmidt <735251+ericreinsmidt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:05:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] The Brick's panel, which is one of six: lcd/brick_panel.c
 reads the panel's ID from DCS registers 0x04 and 0xda-0xdc, as TrimUI's
 U-Boot does, picks that controller's init table (jd9168, otm1289a, st7703,
 nv3052, er68576 or gc9702c, all taken from their U-Boot, with its power
 sequence and timings), powers the panel off and on and sends it. Registered
 as otm1289a, the name TrimUI's device tree gives every Brick. On in
 brick_defconfig

---
 arch/arm64/configs/brick_defconfig            |   1 +
 drivers/video/fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/Makefile |   1 +
 .../video/fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/Kconfig  |   7 +
 .../fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/brick_panel.c  | 713 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/brick_panel.h  |  10 +
 .../video/fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/panels.c |   3 +
 .../video/fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/panels.h |   1 +
 7 files changed, 736 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/video/fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/brick_panel.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/video/fbdev/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/brick_panel.h

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/brick_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/brick_defconfig
index 3a941de2a..008ed81b7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/brick_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/brick_defconfig
@@ -273,6 +273,7 @@ CONFIG_DISP2_SUNXI_SATA_TEST=y
 CONFIG_DISP2_SUNXI=y
 CONFIG_SUNXI_DISP2_FB_HW_ROTATION_SUPPORT=y
